# Every tracked text file is stored AND checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# This is an integrity requirement, not a style preference: the phase manifests
# record byte sizes and SHA-256 digests of tracked files (for example
# tests/fixtures/phase1_oisans_edges.json). With the previous `* text=auto`
# setting a Windows checkout produced CRLF working copies, so the same commit
# yielded a different size and digest than a Linux checkout and the regenerated
# manifest no longer matched the committed one.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.gz binary
*.pbf binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
